# Reset mode: replace instead of layering

## Pyramid Layer

- Layer: L0 convention.

## Use This When

- A schema file, a stored format, or a pattern used in several places needs to change.

## Stop Here If

- The change rewrites the thing in place and every user of it moved in the same change.

## Core rule

- Before production, schema files are rewritten in place rather than accumulated as migrations; local stands are recreated from the schema.
- Move every caller in the same change; do not leave adapters that translate between the old and the new shape.
- Regenerate generated files (`bun run model`) and commit them with the source that produced them.
